{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0624_1000_p", "source_sha256": "29790e052052f95238d7182a23bc1c08808bdbd32b1483205e80d3d0256a3b6c", "ja": "（環の新しい衣装が完成し、試着をしてもらっている。\n天気がモチーフだが、気に入ってくれてるみたいだな）", "zh": "（环的新衣服已经完成，现在正让她试穿。\n虽然以天气为主题，但她好像很喜欢的样子。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0624_1001_040tam", "source_sha256": "eb538e2ddbe8dc2dde1805947ecc267cd61c3f75be05f4b7cc0be6ec247863ec", "ja": "おやぶんおやぶん！　このスカート、傘みたいだね！\nクルクル～って回ると……とってもかわいいぞ～♪", "zh": "大将大将！这条裙子，像伞一样呢！\n转呀转呀～地转起来的话……特别可爱哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0624_1002_p", "source_sha256": "e53978c7fda073c0092a1302e8f58fde63c570178a5a6ec1fc3ff47ff6b70fc7", "ja": "おお、本当だ！\n環に喜んでもらえてよかったよ。", "zh": "哦，真的耶！\n能让环开心，我就放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0624_1003_040tam", "source_sha256": "73d7dafeacf42644408562a21217da68a6b9c96cb2e535b9b47bbbaae5f08cdd", "ja": "くふふ♪　次、いつ雨降るかな～？\nこれがあれば、雨の日もぜったいに楽しいぞ～！", "zh": "嘻嘻♪下次什么时候会下雨呢～？\n有了这个，下雨天也绝对会很开心哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0624_1004_040tam", "source_sha256": "44ce9ba5bd5f0a7b88ad8f18a71e1e86e0485fbaae1a321f21d0556acb664ba0", "ja": "ねぇねぇ、おやぶん！　おやぶんは雨って好き？", "zh": "喂喂，大叔！大叔喜欢下雨吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0624_1005_p", "source_sha256": "3614e6454b8495030e494f6f4e74a5287c74b62071ddabecd11ff6b2abb4493b", "ja": "うん？　そうだな……書類が濡れちゃったりするし。\nちょっとだけ、苦手かもしれないな。", "zh": "嗯？这个嘛……文件会被淋湿之类的。\n可能有点不太喜欢吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0624_1006_040tam", "source_sha256": "5d6b04ce78dc99d9e84b1f0fcfcc5624e6f9804884bf3a481aad5fff9b98ab3d", "ja": "そっかー……。大人になるとそうなのかな？\nお母さんとお父さんも雨が降ると大変って言ってたし。", "zh": "这样啊……。长大以后都会这样吗？\n妈妈和爸爸也说过，下雨的时候会很麻烦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0624_1007_p", "source_sha256": "6beb67a0b3e0205e5644a248f94a02c474a98ffe30b9597ae8a2804281382664", "ja": "ははっ、そうかもしれないな。\nそういう環は、どうなんだ？", "zh": "哈哈，也许真是这样吧。\n像环这样的话，觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0624_1008_040tam", "source_sha256": "b46104f2e5dbf645df1f7cd4a16f1910e267254045b66d5ab79e95febcfd1ad9", "ja": "うーん……。外でボール遊びとかできなく\nなっちゃうのは、ちょっとつまんないけど……。", "zh": "嗯……不能在外面玩球之类的，确实有点没意思……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0624_1009_040tam", "source_sha256": "e40aa6bf4b6db36b575047e6c1014ea652043329ddbb0d32ba89123252195d53", "ja": "でも嫌いじゃないぞ！　カエルとかカタツムリも\nいるし！　水たまりもいっぱいできるから！", "zh": "不过我不讨厌下雨！还有青蛙和蜗牛呢！  \n而且还会积起好多水洼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0624_1010_040tam", "source_sha256": "347ae317b48a62caee03ca134bb5b33573432599adacba6acfffa7df7394d3be", "ja": "お母さんに怒られちゃうから、泥んこ遊びはできない\nけど……ほかにも楽しいこといっぱいだぞ！　くふふ♪", "zh": "因为会被妈妈骂，不能玩泥巴……\n不过，还有好多其他有趣的事哦！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0624_1011_p", "source_sha256": "a2fa1e7dc6c6d5b90608a4446d16ca59e56e4668a78b34f7979c3b57b71db64c", "ja": "そうだな……。大人になると忘れがちだけど。\n雨ならではの楽しみが、たくさんあるな。", "zh": "是啊……虽然长大后很容易忘记。只有下雨天才有的乐趣，真是多得很啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0624_1012_040tam", "source_sha256": "1e77262ca3c519a014bd2d2e512930d11ed91ce42d5f6bda2dd997229d8a9eaf", "ja": "うん！　あと雨のにおいとか……\nあと、雨の後に出る虹も好き！", "zh": "嗯！还有雨水的气味……\n我还喜欢雨后出现的彩虹！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0624_1013_p", "source_sha256": "d0edf96d4663cefb599f3273ef68d4d4e5d2650b5f817e31e30d1e387f79d115", "ja": "虹か。たしかに綺麗だよな。そういえば子供の頃、\n虹の根元を探しに行ったことがあったっけ……。", "zh": "彩虹啊。确实很漂亮。说起来，小时候曾经去找过彩虹的根……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0624_1014_040tam", "source_sha256": "147caf445b928db81e8330f978d445fd160310c3bd2b65bc73f1ffe5d77fa8eb", "ja": "虹の根元……？　それって、虹が出てくるとこ？", "zh": "彩虹的根部……？那是彩虹出现的地方？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0624_1015_p", "source_sha256": "b5c7cfb4a3266b009ab05249d98149c08007f3125c7f5318ba91e3bfc7f98205", "ja": "ああ、そうだよ。虹の根元には宝物が眠ってる\nっていう話が、昔から……。", "zh": "啊，是啊。据说彩虹的根部埋藏着宝物，这个传说从很久以前就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0624_1016_040tam", "source_sha256": "25c9d301125aaf7c12e68dfa4d97d93e4575d5a5e9f1cfb2da8b462c4346a45b", "ja": "えっ、宝物！？　たまき、探しにいきたい！\nおやぶんも一緒にいこうよ！", "zh": "诶，宝物！？环也想去找！\n老大也一起去嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0624_1017_p", "source_sha256": "52f15ab1cf612349eb6b16b1824f1c0c46ed6f65d5a6b07e8a7df65eecf5f24b", "ja": "ごめんな、環。あくまでも、これは噂話なんだ。\n俺も虹の根元は見つけられなかったしな……。", "zh": "对不起，环。说到底，这也只是传闻而已。\n我也没能找到彩虹的根部……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0624_1018_040tam", "source_sha256": "4cffa51515ceffa2c4ccf7f9c9fb7b90882ae7b1104c96cea20c2227fa9905dc", "ja": "そうなんだ……。たまき、おやぶんと宝探ししたかった\nなぁ。どんな宝物か、一緒に見たかったのに……。", "zh": "这样啊……。环还想和老大一起去寻宝的。明明想和老大一起看看那会是什么宝物……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0624_1019_p", "source_sha256": "f6700c13951dd1d7f1009e2ae2171075053793663284af635b83dd4eb7c74531", "ja": "環……。よし！　それじゃこうしよう。\n環は、今度のお仕事を頑張ること！　そうしたら……。", "zh": "环……好！那就这么办。环要努力完成接下来的工作！这样的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0624_1020_p", "source_sha256": "8a1671630572a272bb44ffe1de811e5c9cf762415ef48421c64e0f59b3e7f93e", "ja": "次に虹が出た時、一緒に虹の根元を探そう。\n根元を見つけたら宝探しだ！　それで、どうかな？", "zh": "下次出现彩虹时，我们一起去找彩虹的根吧。\n找到根之后就来寻宝！这样，怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0624_1021_040tam", "source_sha256": "95c80ec6df21a98b8599b17db22d5f38636ad9b06b13d9eb822826d36caac356", "ja": "わあ～。すごく楽しそうだね、おやぶん！\n絶対の絶対に、約束だからね！", "zh": "哇～。听起来好有趣哦，老大！\n绝对绝对，说好了哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0624_1022_040tam", "source_sha256": "8339ce0cc5b0d13b29b516a40f2131470dce0355ec495225556bab54d9f2a9b0", "ja": "たまき、お仕事いっぱい頑張るぞー！\nは～やく雨、降らないっかな～！　くふふ♪", "zh": "环，玉藻会努力做好好多工作的——！\n真希望雨快点下啊～！嘻嘻♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
